{"script":"sj_036_03","des":"贝尔卡-有没有想在这里做的事？","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","y":-248,"mirrow":false,"x":250,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","y":-248,"mirrow":false,"x":250,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]嗯！我想去勘测一下附近的水源！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]高阶水占师们会尝试在水中获取水龙大人的启示……这里的神术太神秘和深奥了，我有些不太擅长。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]而我比较拿手的是，通过对水源的勘测，分析当地的生态和历史人文之类的信息。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]比如水中的元素成分多寡，水流中的生物群落健康状况，水流的流速、流域的地形地貌……通过这些信息，可以大致推测出周边住民的生活状况，还有之前因为这处水域造成的历史事件……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]啊，抱歉抱歉，我说得太复杂了……总之，勘测各地的水源是我的兴趣，这门技术对我将来实现冒险的梦想也有帮助。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]咦，你说这份工作非常有意义……有时间的话，还想陪我一起去勘测水域？真的吗！太好了，我从没有和其他人一起出去实地勘测呢！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]我正好有勘测这片草原附近水源的计划……！不然，心动不如行动，我们这就出发吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}